  "bio": "Genevieve M Val d’Or is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Montreal, Canada, known for her exquisite fineline work that beautifully captures the delicacy of botanical designs and vintage ornaments. As the co-owner of Artemya Tattoo in Val-d'Or and a guest artist at MTLtattoo, she brings a high level of professionalism to every piece, ensuring that clients receive personalized and meticulously crafted tattoos in a welcoming and impeccably clean environment. Her love for fine details is evident in every creation, making her a sought-after artist for those who appreciate the artistry of subtle, yet impactful ink.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Montreal, Quebec, Canada"
